OL,3,CScientists discover source of 'mango-
OL,4,Clike' tropical taste in whisky
OL,6,FResearchers believe they have tracked
OL,7,Fdown the source of whisky's "mango-
OL,8,Flike" tropical taste.
OL,10,FDr Calum Holmes, of Heriot-Watt
OL,11,FUniversity in Edinburgh, said it is
OL,12,Fgood news for distilleries, as they
OL,13,Fcan hopefully now "dial up or tone
OL,14,Fdown tropical aromas" by manipulating
OL,15,Fexisting process steps.
