OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786493896
OL,3,CScientists discover source of 'mango-
OL,4,Clike' tropical taste in whisky
OL,6,FWorking with Japanese drinks giant
OL,7,FKirin, researchers from the university
OL,8,Funcovered some of the chemical
OL,9,Fcompounds that contribute to the
OL,10,Fdevelopment of the mango-like aroma
OL,11,Ffound in certain Scottish and Irish
OL,12,Fwhiskies.
OL,14,FProfessor Annie Hill, from Heriot-
OL,15,FWatt's international centre for
OL,16,Fbrewing and distilling, said: "Fruity
OL,17,Fnotes like banana, apple and pear have
OL,18,Flong been linked to esters, which are
OL,19,Fproduced during fermentation.
OL,26,@xD@_OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
