FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786493896
OL,3,CScientists discover source of 'mango-
OL,4,Clike' tropical taste in whisky
OL,6,F"But we didn't know where the mango
OL,7,Fflavour was coming from ` and now we
OL,8,Fdo."
OL,10,FTakehiko Hiura, a PhD student at
OL,11,FHeriot-Watt, analysed 14 whiskies from
OL,12,FScotland and Ireland and found
OL,13,Faldehydes and acetals, compounds
OL,14,Fcommon in whiskies, can increase
OL,15,Ftropical aroma properties.
OL,17,FThe study found one whisky contained
OL,18,Fparticularly high levels of three key
OL,19,Fcompounds: isobutyraldehyde,
OL,20,Fisovaleraldehyde and isovaleraldehyde
OL,21,Fdiethyl acetal.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@DO]
