PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786493896
OL,3,CScientists discover source of 'mango-
OL,4,Clike' tropical taste in whisky
OL,6,FWhen the team spiked a whisky
OL,7,Fpresenting as low for mango aroma with
OL,8,Fthese chemicals, the fruity aroma
OL,9,Fincreased substantially.
OL,11,FThe research was recently reported in
OL,12,Fthe Journal of the American Society of
OL,13,FBrewing Chemists.
